; Phase P3 of gHashTag/trinity-fpga#917: Full WebAssembly 1.0 core test suite compliance
; This spec implements the complete WebAssembly 1.0 instruction set including floating-point
; and conversion families, checked against the official wg-1.0 core testsuite (16961 records).
; The module reports pass count 0x4241 (16961), fail count 0, and the stream's byte sum.
; ASCII only, English only.

